s.\",\n      \"C: Individual efforts are united toward organisational goals; the stem does not mention or exclude this condition.\"\n    ],\n    \"distractors\": [\n      {\n        \"option\": \"A\",\n        \"decisively_wrong\": false,\n        \"basis\": \"source_silence\",\n        \"reason\": \"The stem does not address whether functions are performed simultaneously by all managers all the time.\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"option\": \"B\",\n        \"decisively_wrong\": false,\n        \"basis\": \"source_silence\",\n        \"reason\": \"The stem compares managers across organisations but does not rule out teamwork within those organisations.\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"option\": \"C\",\n        \"decisively_wrong\": false,\n        \"basis\": \"source_silence\",\n        \"reason\": \"The stem does not mention organisational goals or united individual efforts, but does not rule them out.\"\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}"
